        (7 7 7 2 2 2 2 7 7 7)
        (7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7)
        (7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7)
        (7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7 7))))))

(alts $r
  (alt $ReachAcross
    (witness rectangle-block variant concept
      (relaxed one-square-block)
      (separates "A 2-row, 5-column block, with one mark 3 cells above it and one 3 cells to its right. The concept measures the reach along the pull (2 above, 5 to the right), $ReachAcross along the side faced, $ReachMin the shorter extent, and $ReachMax the longer, so each lands a different set of the two marks on the block.")
